msgid "On start-up an access point is created with name \"ardupilot\".  The default password is also \"ardupilot\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:36
#: 6177ab3bbb6a41498f1d265eac04333b
msgid "The user can connect to this access point and then easily connect to ArduPilot running on the autopilot by setting their ground station (including Mission Planner) to connect using \"UDP\", port 14550."
