#: ../../source/docs/apsync-intro.rst:44
#: 3b3479aca4b3472d815b63f9318360b3
msgid "Dataflash logs are streamed to the companion computer via MAVLink and stored on the companion computer's filesystem (as well as on the pixhawk's dataflash). Dataflash log files can then be quickly downloaded (over wifi) using a script (Windows users may use `apsync-download-logs <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync/apsync-download-logs-latest.zip>`__) or you may pull the SD card out of the companion computer."
msgstr ""

